From: swear01 <stanley.yellow1@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:54:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/29] fork: ship the hapi-session-control skill with HAPI

Fork-only overlay, stacked on the spawn_peer / reply forwarding PR. It
replaces the skill delivery that #1771 carried.

- Bundle cli/skills/hapi-session-control/SKILL.md, rewritten for
  spawn_peer, ping_peer waitForReply and inspect_peer.
- Install it into each agent's native skill root on session bootstrap.
  A failed install is logged and does not block the session.
- Point HOME at the temp test home in the CLI test setup, so tests that
  bootstrap sessions no longer write into the real ~/.claude and ~/.codex.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 3efcb7ec68d861cec6156e1c54bbd2d15e838c76)
